{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20775","headline":"常州孟谏议座上闻韩员外职方贬国子博士有感五首 三 · 卢仝","name":"常州孟谏议座上闻韩员外职方贬国子博士有感五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事遭朝贬，知何被不容。\n不如思所自，只欲涕无从。\n爵服何曾好，荷衣已惯缝。\n朝官莫相识，归去老岩松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}